OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews respond to blaze at
OL,4,Arecycling plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a blaze at a
OL,7,Frecycling centre in Nottinghamshire.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid six crews were sent to the
OL,11,Fbusiness, which is located near the A46
OL,12,Fin Cotgrave, on Wednesday.
OL,14,FThe service said its control room had
OL,15,Freceived a large number of calls about
OL,16,Fthe fire.
OL,18,FA spokesperson confirmed that the fire
OL,19,Fwas located at a metal recycling plant.
